You will need to make the device before it can be accessed.
cd /dev
You will also need to know which bus/target the tape device is on so you
can make the correct device.
eg if the tape is on bus 2 target 3  then multiply 2*8 (number of
targets per bus in 4.x) and add 3 to get 19.
The device will be tz19
in /dev "./MAKEDEV tz19"
This will create the rmt0* devices.
To make sure its working do a "file" on rmt0* it should return the
device id and target info.

Nick



