I'm unsure what you mean by "port is out of order". If you can't get
at the >>> prompt, this might help:

Connect keyboard & VGA Monitor. Power up machine. Wait for the OCP to
display the model name (or whatever you set it to). Then hit some
keys. The Console will notice you typing, and switch to graphics,
displaying the >>> prompt. 

Then set CONSOLE to GRAPHICS, and INIT.

This worked on both 2x00 and 4x00 for me.

