Printing 5 -- Network lpd remote printing
=========================================================================

     lp|lp0|0:\
             :lf=/usr/adm/lp0err:\
             :lp=:\
             :rm=system_name:\
             :rp=queue_name:\
             :sd=/usr/spool/lpd0:

    Print filters are not used, even when specified.  Printing features such
