Hi,

I did a similar task with cloning the entire disk.

I put the target disk in the source node and (in single user mode) cloned with

dd if=/dev/rrz0 of=/dev/rrz5 bs=<as much as possible>

It took less than one hour for one disk (16 GB) and copied anything including
the LSM setup of the root disk.

